<title>FINLAND: ORION NAMES INSTRU'S TALONEN CEO.</title>
<headline>ORION NAMES INSTRU'S TALONEN CEO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish pharmaceuticals group Orion-Yhtyma Oy said in a statement received on Wednesday that it had appointed Markku Talonen president and CEO from June 15.</p>
<p>Talonen is currently president and CEO of Finnish medical equipment maker Instrumentarium Oy.</p>
<p>He succeeds Aatto Prihti, who remains a member of the board of directors, Orion said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
